{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":33.91999816894531,"text":"Five and a half thousand years ago, long before the pyramids, a young man was buried in a shallow pit in the desert, curled on his side, with no coffin. The hot, dry sand drew the water out of his body and preserved it. Even his reddish hair is still there. The Egyptians saw what sand could do, and later learned to do it themselves, with salt and bandages. In 2012, the museum put him through a CT scanner and found he had been wounded in the back. Visitors see him as he was found, lying in his sand.","words":[{"word":"Five","start":0,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"and","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"a","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.2200000286102295},{"word":"half","start":1.2200000286102295,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"thousand","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.840000033378601},{"word":"years","start":1.840000033378601,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"ago","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"long","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"before","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"the","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"pyramids","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":4.099999904632568},{"word":"a","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.679999828338623},{"word":"young","start":4.679999828338623,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"man","start":4.920000076293945,"end":5.199999809265137},{"word":"was","start":5.199999809265137,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"buried","start":5.599999904632568,"end":5.679999828338623},{"word":"in","start":5.679999828338623,"end":5.920000076293945},{"word":"a","start":5.920000076293945,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"shallow","start":6.420000076293945,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"pit","start":6.420000076293945,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"in","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.880000114440918},{"word":"the","start":6.88